      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The current behavior is that a click does not register until it is released.  This is by design and not a bug. It will cause unintended behavior as described when double clicking and moving the cursor before releasing the second click. This will not be changed in the foreseeable future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
