  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-10T01:14:14.150Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nDouble clicking on the Tabs in the Quick Menu and then holding down to scrub through the Tabs will cause the double click actions (e.g. Turning on the Camera or Earmuffs) to activate.\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Open the Quick Menu\n2. Double Click on the Launch Pad Tab (continue to hold down after the second click)\n3. Move your mouse over the different Tabs\nIf you do this you will notice that once you go over the Camera Tab you will activate it.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/xrcsp6",
